  "solution": {
    "text": "For ideal gas, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>  <br/>Therefore, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>Therefore, the change in temperature is: <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
